      "severity": "minor",
      "status": "resolved",
      "descriptionMarkdown": "**`source_layout` fails on OS and editor metadata files** (`crates/rayx_app_nsh/tests/source_layout.rs:80-90`).\n\nExpected: the group fails only on a file or folder that differs from d-layout, and the owner runs it on macOS. Observed: `files()` collects every directory entry, so a Finder `.DS_Store` in any `src/` folder, or an editor swap or backup file (`.builder_ts.rs.swp`), fails both checks with \"extra file src/.DS_Store\" although the layout is right. Git ignores these files, so `git status` stays clean while the test fails. Otherwise the test is sound: the exact expected set catches every stray, missing or misnamed file and every non-empty stray folder, and `SERVICES` is separate so t13 can replace it.\n\nRepair: in `files()`, skip entries whose file name starts with `.`, and note that in its doc comment. A `.DS_Store` placed in `src/services/` should then leave both tests passing, and a stray `src/services/foo.rs` should still fail.\n\nResolved: `files()` skips entries whose name starts with `.`, documented in its comment; the exact expected set still catches a stray `.rs` file.",
